quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  40,59,"Indeed, the Hour is surely coming. There is no doubt about it. But most people do not believe."
  40,60,"Your Lord says: ‘Call upon Me, I shall respond to you. Indeed, those too arrogant to worship Me shall enter Hell in utter humiliation.’"
  40,61,"Allah is the One Who made the night for you where you may rest and the day to see. Indeed, Allah is Ever-Gracious to humankind, but most people do not give thanks."
  40,62,"That is Allah, your Lord, Who is the Creator of everything. There is no god except Him. So, where are you being turned away?"
  40,63,"Thus, those who used to deny the revelations of Allah were turned away (from the truth)."
  40,64,"Allah is the One Who made the earth a settling place for you and the sky a canopy. And He shaped you (in your mother’s womb) and then perfected your forms. And He provided you with all the good things (required for your development). That is Allah, your Lord! So blessed is Allah, the Lord of all worlds."
  40,65,"He is the Ever-Living. There is no god except Him. So call upon Him, devoting faith and obedience entirely to Him. All praise belongs to Allah, the Lord of all worlds."
  40,66,Say: ‘I have been forbidden to worship those (idols) you invoke besides Allah since clear proofs have come to me from my Lord. And I have been commanded to submit to the Lord of all worlds.’
